Title: The Same Decision on the Fixed Grid.
Note: The same sums in Q31.32: each literal rounded once to the 2^-32 grid and noted, the decision exact on the raws.
§1 Let b be 0.1 plus 0.2.
§2 If b equals 0.3, say "fixed: equal".
§3 Otherwise, say "fixed: not equal".
§4 Let d be 0.1 plus 0.1 plus 0.1.
§5 If d equals 0.3, say "fixed: three tenths equal".
§6 Otherwise, say "fixed: three tenths not equal".
